      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Precinct 5 tutorial: Removed the self-rez power from the Target Dummy Clockworks. They will now respawn when destroyed. They were taking a step each time they self-repaired, eventually wandering far from where they were supposed to be."
    },
    {
      "category": "PRAETORIA",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Precinct 5 tutorial: Fixed a bug that would sometimes grant Kalinda as a contact to new Praetorians."
    },
    {
      "category": "PRAETORIA",
      "subsection": "",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "Precinct 5 tutorial: If you somehow manage to die in the tutorial and select ‘go to hospital’, you will resurrect next to Officer Flint."
